This project is a VS Code / Cursor extension that uses IBM's tnz library
for TN3270 protocol handling, and the ebcdic library for the EBCDIC code
pages that are not in the Python standard library.

Both are redistributed inside the packaged extension, under
extension/sidecar/vendor/. Each keeps its own dist-info directory there,
including its license file. Neither is modified.

tnz
Copyright IBM Inc.
Author: Neil Johnson
License: Apache License 2.0
Source: https://github.com/IBM/tnz

ebcdic
Copyright (c) Thomas Aglassinger
License: BSD 2-Clause "Simplified" License
Source: https://github.com/roskakori/CodecMapper

Neither library is committed to this repository. Both are fetched from PyPI
at package time by scripts/package.js, from sidecar/requirements.txt. To work
against them without packaging:

    pip install -r sidecar/requirements.txt
